   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "An action in progress",
     "texto": [
      "**-고 있어요** presents an action in progress: 먹다 → **먹고 있어요** (I'm eating), 공부하다 → **공부하고 있어요** (I'm studying), 자다 → **자고 있어요** (is sleeping). It is common with **지금**, but context can also make the moment clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Compared with -아/어요",
     "texto": [
      "The present **-아/어요** can talk about habits or current situations: **매일 공부해요** = I study every day; **지금 공부해요** can also mean «I study now». **-고 있어요** stresses that the action is in progress: **지금 공부하고 있어요** = I'm studying now. Do not mechanically translate every -아/어요 form as a habit."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
